cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CMN-JAX: Differentiable toy neurons with ATP and ion constraints"
authors:
  - family-names: Kaneko
    given-names: Takuma
version: "0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kaneman777/CMN-JAX"
url: "https://github.com/kaneman777/CMN-JAX"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Preliminary independent research prototype: JAX point neurons with Na/K pump,
  ATP state, optional local K_e diffusion, and synaptic coupling. Documents
  toy-level previews for selective coding, slow traces, supply stress, and
  task-dependent scoring of synaptic vs K_e pathways. Not a claim of biological
  reproduction, field creation, or Adam replacement.
keywords:
  - JAX
  - biophysical neuron
  - ATP
  - ion homeostasis
  - differentiable simulation
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.24283139"
